<div class="bb-quote"><b>Nielzabub wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class="bb-quote-body">&nbsp;I&#39;ve never personally had much issue with the Sonic. It is a magic wand, but most of the &quot;science&quot; in the show is gobbledygook anyway.&nbsp;
